OL,3,GNEWSADisabled people 'failed most' in
OL,4,Aairport chaos, says teen left queuing
OL,5,Afor hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FA disabled teenager left queuing for
OL,8,Fhours in an airport says people with
OL,9,Fadditional needs are disproportionately
OL,10,Faffected during major travel
OL,11,Fdisruption.
OL,13,FJosephine Rogers, 19, from Newport,
OL,14,Fsaid the special assistance she needed
OL,15,Fat Schiphol Airport in Amsterdam was
OL,16,Funavailable when her flight back to
OL,17,FWales was one of more than 150
OL,18,Fcancelled flights amid UK-wide air
OL,19,Ftraffic control issues on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,440,430,260,140,0,100
