OL,3,GNEWSADisabled people 'failed most' in
OL,4,Aairport chaos, says teen left queuing
OL,5,Afor hours
OL,6,
OL,7,FShe was in a group of 13 young people
OL,8,Fwho spent eight hours stuck in the
OL,9,Fairport after a cultural exchange in
OL,10,FFinland.
OL,12,FSchiphol Airport said it understood
OL,13,F"how frustrating" the situation was and
OL,14,Fencouraged those who felt "assistance
OL,15,Fprovided did not meet expectations" to
OL,16,Fmake a formal complaint.
